FireSky ports selected solar formulae from astral/sun.py, astral/julian.py
and astral/__init__.py to native/src/astronomy.rs and engine/src/astronomy.rs.
The port adds Rust types, input/resource bounds, a C ABI, IANA timezone
handling, threshold/window orchestration and shared solar terms. It retains
the reference's geometric-centre, refraction and second-resolution contracts.
These are modified translations, not unmodified upstream source files.
